WEBVTT

00:00:06.680 --> 00:00:08.850
Is that the old man?

00:00:08.850 --> 00:00:11.570
So you were hiding your true 
power after all, you old geezer.

00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:19.300
I want courage...

00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:22.350
The courage to jump right at that thing!

00:00:29.180 --> 00:00:32.340
Lend me your power, Eiko!

00:00:55.030 --> 00:00:56.110
Not bad.

00:01:02.830 --> 00:01:04.010
Old man!

00:01:23.820 --> 00:01:24.520
Here I go!

00:01:40.660 --> 00:01:45.200
<b><i>Planet With</i></b>

00:03:00.450 --> 00:03:06.870
<b>Episode 6: Paladin Break 2</b>

00:03:00.640 --> 00:03:03.080
What's going on here?

00:03:03.080 --> 00:03:04.740
I'm completely confused!

00:03:05.690 --> 00:03:07.820
Cameraman, get a shot of them!

00:03:09.300 --> 00:03:09.910
Huh?

00:03:09.910 --> 00:03:10.870
That's strange.

00:03:11.110 --> 00:03:12.850
I just can't get it focused...

00:03:13.930 --> 00:03:16.300
Jamming, jamming...

00:03:16.510 --> 00:03:17.320
Here you go.

00:03:19.670 --> 00:03:20.970
Take mine, too.

00:03:21.730 --> 00:03:23.360
I'm not giving these back.

00:03:23.360 --> 00:03:24.300
That's fine.

00:03:24.620 --> 00:03:29.520
I only had it so I could grab 
the old man when he fell.

00:03:29.800 --> 00:03:30.700
I see.

00:03:41.490 --> 00:03:42.200
Hey.

00:03:42.980 --> 00:03:45.570
Does this mean your revenge is over?

00:03:46.340 --> 00:03:50.000
The "dragon" that destroyed 
your planet is gone now, right?

00:03:50.340 --> 00:03:54.780
Yeah. Just like I told you before,
 I heard the dragon died...

00:03:55.260 --> 00:03:56.960
After it destroyed my planet.

00:03:57.920 --> 00:03:59.670
But it's not over yet.

00:04:00.470 --> 00:04:01.740
He's still here.

00:04:02.410 --> 00:04:05.260
The one with the strongest 
aura of the dragon...

00:04:18.620 --> 00:04:21.780
"You would destroy your own 
base with no hesitation?"

00:04:22.050 --> 00:04:24.700
That's what you want to say, 
isn't it, Generalissimo?

00:04:25.420 --> 00:04:28.740
Pay attention, Nebula Leader.

00:04:29.210 --> 00:04:32.910
Plasma Bullet!

00:04:36.500 --> 00:04:39.090
"I underestimated the desire for 
conflict Earth's humans have!"

00:04:39.370 --> 00:04:41.350
That's what you want to say, 
isn't it, Generalissimo?

00:04:42.700 --> 00:04:45.950
"We'll be outmatched if we try 
to avoid damaging the town."

00:04:45.950 --> 00:04:47.140
"Let's end this now!"

00:04:47.350 --> 00:04:48.520
Right, Generalissimo?

00:04:50.420 --> 00:04:51.310
Here we go!

00:04:52.030 --> 00:04:55.600
Wepwawet Bite!

00:05:06.420 --> 00:05:08.490
Why did you try to attack the town?

00:05:08.990 --> 00:05:10.740
It was just a little test.

00:05:12.980 --> 00:05:15.250
And why do you care if the town is damaged?

00:05:15.580 --> 00:05:17.080
Invaders!

00:05:18.830 --> 00:05:21.630
"Our goal is to restrain and seal away

00:05:21.630 --> 00:05:24.800
the aggressive evolution of immature races."

00:05:24.800 --> 00:05:26.430
"It's not destruction or invasion!"

00:05:26.800 --> 00:05:28.810
So says the Generalissimo.

00:05:28.810 --> 00:05:30.690
Just come out and say that

00:05:30.690 --> 00:05:34.630
you don't want to ruin our value as a colony.

00:05:38.350 --> 00:05:40.270
Our goal is to seal—

00:05:40.580 --> 00:05:43.860
You're trying to control others based 
on your own values and reasons!

00:05:44.530 --> 00:05:46.570
If that's not invasion...

00:05:48.720 --> 00:05:50.090
What is?

00:05:51.580 --> 00:05:56.950
"If you want to call taking a loaded 
gun from a child 'invasion,' then fine!"

00:05:56.950 --> 00:05:58.870
So says the Generalissimo.

00:06:00.360 --> 00:06:04.630
Others only seem young to you 
because you are arrogant.

00:06:05.130 --> 00:06:11.180
Shiraishi-kun, tell me why you 
gave me information about Nebula.

00:06:11.700 --> 00:06:15.930
The Generalissimo wanted things to 
be fair. His aesthetics demands it.

00:06:15.930 --> 00:06:19.800
He didn't want the Earth to fall 
to a surprise attack from Nebula.

00:06:19.800 --> 00:06:22.480
He wanted us to know each other well,
 to let you prepare,

00:06:22.480 --> 00:06:25.640
and then make you admit 
defeat after a fair fight.

00:06:25.640 --> 00:06:28.840
It's the only way to stop martial force 
from turning into pure violence.

00:06:28.840 --> 00:06:31.110
And that's proof of your arrogance!

00:06:31.110 --> 00:06:33.770
The very idea mocks us!

00:06:33.770 --> 00:06:37.530
To begin with, aesthetics have 
no place in martial conflict!

00:06:37.530 --> 00:06:41.330
Platitudes cannot change the true 
nature of its terrible destruction.

00:06:42.580 --> 00:06:45.090
This evil power of ours...

00:06:46.900 --> 00:06:49.810
...must be controlled!

00:06:52.220 --> 00:06:55.850
That's why we came to this planet!

00:06:56.030 --> 00:06:57.180
No.

00:06:57.180 --> 00:06:58.890
I'll be the one to control it.

00:06:59.660 --> 00:07:03.110
I shall remove all martial 
force from this planet,

00:07:03.250 --> 00:07:07.330
and I will be the only one who 
possesses a force that surpasses it!

00:07:07.330 --> 00:07:10.600
And I shall be the guardian of justice!

00:07:10.600 --> 00:07:12.100
I shall rule over everything,

00:07:12.100 --> 00:07:16.020
and stop all civilizations everywhere 
from using force against others!

00:07:16.920 --> 00:07:19.250
I promise the whole universe

00:07:19.250 --> 00:07:23.180
that I will make this existence a paradise,

00:07:23.180 --> 00:07:24.590
a peaceful reality without war!

00:07:33.310 --> 00:07:35.380
I'm sick of this!

00:07:35.380 --> 00:07:37.100
Let me talk directly!

00:07:37.100 --> 00:07:37.950
Generalissimo!

00:07:37.950 --> 00:07:39.780
Stand strong, Shiraishi.

00:07:39.780 --> 00:07:41.350
Deploy that shield!

00:07:41.350 --> 00:07:42.390
Understood!

00:07:42.390 --> 00:07:46.170
Deploying Superdimensional Shield!

00:07:47.220 --> 00:07:50.360
Thor's Hammer!

00:08:00.490 --> 00:08:04.540
The Superdimensional Shield 
deflects an attack into subspace,

00:08:04.540 --> 00:08:07.710
infinitely nullifying any kind of attack.

00:08:08.660 --> 00:08:09.720
But...

00:08:10.670 --> 00:08:14.390
Why? Why does this attack 
still feel so powerful!

00:08:15.000 --> 00:08:16.720
The city is in a panic!

00:08:17.010 --> 00:08:20.310
<i>What's going to happen to 
this city... No, to Japan?!</i>

00:08:26.950 --> 00:08:28.010
They're fighting...

00:08:28.760 --> 00:08:30.600
The dragon is fighting over there!

00:08:35.240 --> 00:08:37.700
Takashi Ryuzoji...

00:08:38.280 --> 00:08:42.480
The strongest psychic on Earth.

00:08:42.480 --> 00:08:45.570
That's why we were so interested in him.

00:08:46.170 --> 00:08:48.420
The other sealing devices that 
appeared around the world

00:08:48.420 --> 00:08:50.420
were just shadows, sent to deceive.

00:08:50.970 --> 00:08:54.680
The one that appeared in his city was real.

00:08:54.890 --> 00:08:56.890
But what is he?

00:08:57.400 --> 00:09:01.420
His psychic wavelength is 
the same as the dragon's.

00:09:01.420 --> 00:09:05.610
If the wavelength was extremely similar,
 that would be one thing.

00:09:05.610 --> 00:09:11.780
But are his obsessive ideas about force
 and justice the same as the dragon?

00:09:12.260 --> 00:09:14.440
The dragon's supposed to be dead!

00:09:14.870 --> 00:09:18.200
The dragon was a part of Nebula's forces.

00:09:18.400 --> 00:09:21.710
Its own sense of justice
 compelled it to destroy

00:09:22.040 --> 00:09:25.310
the warlike Siriusian race 
without authorization,

00:09:25.310 --> 00:09:28.000
and it was executed via space-time banishment.

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:29.710
I saw it happen.

00:09:30.440 --> 00:09:37.630
A thousand of Nebula's strongest 
empaths, including Shiraishi,

00:09:37.630 --> 00:09:42.550
as well as seventy-seven sealing devices were
used to restrain its desire to resist,

00:09:42.550 --> 00:09:44.950
and it was thrown in a space-time hole.

00:09:44.950 --> 00:09:46.870
I saw it happen!

00:09:51.640 --> 00:09:55.730
It must have died in the subspace 
beyond the space-time hole,

00:09:55.730 --> 00:10:00.320
swallowed up in a storm of space 
and time with no physical laws.

00:10:00.320 --> 00:10:02.290
Takashi Ryuzoji...

00:10:02.290 --> 00:10:06.040
Is he the dragon's reincarnation?

00:10:09.850 --> 00:10:11.250
That's a good shield.

00:10:11.990 --> 00:10:14.920
Then I'll attack directly!

00:10:24.430 --> 00:10:27.560
<i>One of them is continuing 
to harass the other!</i>

00:10:27.560 --> 00:10:30.380
<i>It seems this is a one-sided battle.</i>

00:10:33.840 --> 00:10:35.430
Let's go, Sensei!

00:10:36.400 --> 00:10:38.520
"We'll head back to the spaceship first,"

00:10:38.520 --> 00:10:40.500
Sensei says.

00:10:41.130 --> 00:10:41.740
Why?

00:10:42.060 --> 00:10:43.950
Just do it, Soya-kun.

00:10:43.950 --> 00:10:45.370
Fine.

00:10:45.970 --> 00:10:47.740
What a pain...

00:10:47.740 --> 00:10:48.660
Wait.

00:10:49.890 --> 00:10:52.250
Are you going to fight Takashi?

00:10:52.480 --> 00:10:53.670
Takashi?

00:10:53.670 --> 00:10:55.230
Takashi Ryuzoji.

00:10:55.230 --> 00:10:57.780
The guy who's the boss of the Earthlings.

00:10:57.780 --> 00:10:58.470
Oh.

00:10:58.890 --> 00:10:59.820
Yeah, I'll fight him.

00:10:59.820 --> 00:11:00.600
And defeat him.

00:11:01.120 --> 00:11:05.350
Takashi used to be a kind kid.

00:11:06.030 --> 00:11:09.560
He'd fight bullies to protect 
the weak and things like that.

00:11:09.860 --> 00:11:11.220
So what?

00:11:11.220 --> 00:11:12.690
I'm still going to kick the crap out of him.

00:11:13.580 --> 00:11:16.690
Take that power away from him.

00:11:17.940 --> 00:11:22.820
Without the power to force 
his justice on others,

00:11:22.820 --> 00:11:25.950
he might go back to being the kind boy he was.

00:11:26.600 --> 00:11:28.980
Being able to endure the 
unfairness of the world

00:11:28.980 --> 00:11:33.400
and still remain kind is a 
more noble thing than justice.

00:11:33.400 --> 00:11:34.750
Can you tell him that?

00:11:36.200 --> 00:11:39.250
I don't like parents who tell 
their kids to suck it up.

00:11:39.710 --> 00:11:42.380
But, well, I'll tell him if I have time.

00:12:03.880 --> 00:12:05.030
Right, Sensei!

00:12:05.450 --> 00:12:08.150
Soya-kun, move to the right a little.

00:12:08.700 --> 00:12:10.410
Ready, and...

00:12:12.310 --> 00:12:13.710
Excuse me!

00:12:14.600 --> 00:12:16.760
"We'll fight with the energy of two people."

00:12:16.760 --> 00:12:18.920
That's what Sensei says.

00:12:18.920 --> 00:12:19.550
What?

00:12:19.550 --> 00:12:21.670
This thing can fit two people?

00:12:22.160 --> 00:12:24.070
Fine, but don't get in my way, Ginko.

00:12:24.070 --> 00:12:25.550
Right, right.

00:12:25.550 --> 00:12:26.900
Let's go, Sensei.

00:12:28.230 --> 00:12:31.930
Sensei says to wait for them here.

00:12:31.930 --> 00:12:33.410
Wait for them?

00:12:33.410 --> 00:12:34.150
Why?

00:12:34.150 --> 00:12:35.400
Just do it.

00:12:40.830 --> 00:12:41.780
It's over!

00:12:41.780 --> 00:12:43.360
Now, Shiraishi!

00:12:43.780 --> 00:12:44.860
Right, Generalissimo!

00:12:52.890 --> 00:12:53.930
That's...

00:12:59.840 --> 00:13:01.050
What?

00:13:06.750 --> 00:13:11.100
The shield's emergency escape 
device activated properly.

00:13:11.800 --> 00:13:14.990
The short warp exit was just where 
the default settings put it.

00:13:16.150 --> 00:13:19.020
Let us leave the rest to him.

00:13:36.890 --> 00:13:37.620
There it is!

00:13:38.060 --> 00:13:39.500
What just happened?

00:13:52.340 --> 00:13:54.330
S-Soya-kun!

00:13:59.060 --> 00:14:00.840
Soya-kun! This is a residential area!

00:14:00.840 --> 00:14:02.320
It's an evacuation zone!

00:14:17.700 --> 00:14:18.920
There we go!

00:14:29.720 --> 00:14:31.850
They turned into a dragon!

00:14:31.850 --> 00:14:32.970
It doesn't matter!

00:14:38.620 --> 00:14:41.960
I'll just keep punching him, so he
 doesn't have time to breathe,

00:14:41.960 --> 00:14:43.900
and defeat him now!

00:14:43.900 --> 00:14:44.530
Are you a monster?

00:14:51.060 --> 00:14:51.950
What?

00:14:51.950 --> 00:14:52.620
Lightning?

00:14:55.590 --> 00:14:57.140
What happened?

00:14:57.140 --> 00:15:00.540
How did I lose the advantage 
in a single instant?

00:15:02.610 --> 00:15:05.130
Damn it. I didn't finish him...

00:15:05.130 --> 00:15:06.650
Wow...

00:15:06.650 --> 00:15:09.440
I don't even know what's going on now.

00:15:10.030 --> 00:15:13.560
Huh? "The Sealing Faction 
made us deal with him"?

00:15:13.560 --> 00:15:14.850
Is that what you said, Sensei?

00:15:15.810 --> 00:15:19.080
"That's the kind of guy he is"?

00:15:19.080 --> 00:15:21.190
You mean the Generalissimo 
of the Sealing Faction?

00:15:21.190 --> 00:15:22.800
Shut up. You're distracting me!

00:15:22.800 --> 00:15:24.110
I'm fighting now!

00:15:42.010 --> 00:15:45.840
Can the Pacifists defeat Takashi Ryuzoji?

00:15:46.470 --> 00:15:48.420
They can.

00:15:48.880 --> 00:15:51.380
That's part of who he is.

00:15:54.890 --> 00:15:56.100
<i>Kuroi-kun...</i>

00:16:00.440 --> 00:16:03.480
Looks like they teleported me somehow.

00:16:03.480 --> 00:16:06.100
He's the first Nebula Soldier?

00:16:06.440 --> 00:16:09.190
He looks a little different than 
the one I saw before, but...

00:16:09.680 --> 00:16:11.030
It doesn't matter.

00:16:11.030 --> 00:16:14.980
I'll just destroy anyone that gets in my way!

00:16:31.220 --> 00:16:33.460
Nebula, listen to me!

00:16:33.460 --> 00:16:35.680
I will mete out all of this world's justice!

00:16:36.210 --> 00:16:38.970
There is no need for your force!

00:16:39.240 --> 00:16:42.140
Behold my ultimate strike!

00:16:42.480 --> 00:16:47.040
This is the true hammer of justice!

00:16:48.610 --> 00:16:50.640
That's not good news, Soya-kun!

00:16:50.640 --> 00:16:52.070
Sensei says fall back!

00:16:52.070 --> 00:16:53.400
No way!

00:16:55.070 --> 00:16:56.240
You'll still fight me, then?

00:16:56.240 --> 00:16:57.830
Very well!

00:16:59.120 --> 00:17:00.950
Giga Cat...

00:17:00.950 --> 00:17:04.250
Zeus Keravnos!

00:17:04.250 --> 00:17:06.710
...Blade!

00:17:15.390 --> 00:17:17.480
Hang in there, Ginko!

00:17:18.090 --> 00:17:20.530
If we can't redirect the 
entire attack upward,

00:17:20.530 --> 00:17:23.240
it'll burn this entire area to the ground!

00:17:23.240 --> 00:17:23.970
Okay!

00:17:23.970 --> 00:17:25.110
Sorry, Sensei!

00:17:25.110 --> 00:17:26.600
I know it hurts, but try to hang in there!

00:17:28.360 --> 00:17:30.440
Protect this town from the dragon!

00:17:34.650 --> 00:17:36.110
<i>Just like my brother...</i>

00:17:40.490 --> 00:17:43.110
<i>Just like my brother tried to protect them...</i>

00:17:45.550 --> 00:17:46.960
I can do the same thing!

00:18:46.150 --> 00:18:47.600
I'm not done yet!

00:18:47.600 --> 00:18:51.320
Don't get distracted!

00:19:08.790 --> 00:19:10.620
I have to get him off of me...

00:19:13.340 --> 00:19:15.340
I have no power left.

00:19:15.570 --> 00:19:20.060
Super Ultra Tiger Slash!

00:19:24.310 --> 00:19:27.100
I can't let you beat me!

00:19:32.350 --> 00:19:33.900
For...

00:19:39.230 --> 00:19:40.940
...justice!

00:19:43.910 --> 00:19:45.280
Take this!

00:19:45.280 --> 00:19:46.910
My hammer of vengeance!

00:19:48.360 --> 00:19:50.370
Clog Punch!

00:19:52.020 --> 00:19:56.830
Justice isn't even as useful as this clog!

00:20:17.920 --> 00:20:19.230
Impossible...

00:20:20.040 --> 00:20:24.020
If I... If I'm defeated...

00:20:24.020 --> 00:20:25.370
...justice will...

00:20:28.790 --> 00:20:30.590
I have a message from your dad.

00:20:30.590 --> 00:20:34.080
Something about enduring something being 
better than justice, or something.

00:20:34.920 --> 00:20:37.540
What the hell? That's pretty vague.

00:20:39.360 --> 00:20:41.920
He says kindness is best.

00:20:50.380 --> 00:20:52.250
Maybe he's right.

00:20:56.130 --> 00:20:58.970
Now, I've won, old man.

00:20:58.970 --> 00:21:00.810
How did you get the dragon's power—

00:21:03.200 --> 00:21:03.940
Hey.

00:21:28.470 --> 00:21:30.300
Brother?

00:22:02.170 --> 00:22:04.860
It's over, Brother.

00:22:07.010 --> 00:22:10.010
<b><i>To Be Continued</i></b>

00:23:40.020 --> 00:23:45.310
<b><i>Next Time
Sirius</i></b>

00:23:43.860 --> 00:23:45.310
"Sirius."
